function sound(){if(!settings.sound)return;try{let a=audioCtx||(audioCtx=new(window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext)());a.resume();let o=a.createOscillator(),g=a.createGain();o.frequency.setValueAtTime(520,a.currentTime);o.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(900,a.currentTime+.07);g.gain.setValueAtTime(.025,a.currentTime);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,a.currentTime+.12);o.connect(g).connect(a.destination);o.start();o.stop(a.currentTime+.13)}catch{}}let audioCtx;
